					"content": "你找到木桩了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200620302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 200620302,
					"content": "找到了，可是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200620303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200620303,
					"content": "哈…你下手也太狠了，这么结实的木桩都被打散架了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200620304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 200620304,
					"content": "不过在战斗的时候，确实不会有人顾得上为了个木桩收手…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200620305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 200620305,
					"content": "虽然不能直接给艾琳…但材料已经有了，我来加工一下就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200620306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 200620306,
					"content": "勉强是组装起来了，你看，呃…还是有点模样的，对吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200620307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 200620307,
					"content": "总之谢谢你了。这是报酬，我说了不会让你打白工的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200620308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 200620308,
					"content": "虽然我不是冒险家了，但是冒险家的规矩可不能坏啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "赫尔曼"
				}
			]
		},
